  "findings": [
    "The native full/hero/low3q retain191 doorway depth, actual roof-seated support positions and original171 receiver arrays. Exact source/native protected comparisons pass.",
    "Broad rounded arms now have stepped/waisted profiles and real14mm carved coves. Repeated191 cast end sleeves are retired; original small shoes use rough aged gilt. Actual relief uses improved cap triangulation, analytic normals and its own matte finish.",
    "One shadow-casting sun and the independent measured sky replace the unoccluded directional/hemi/ambient fills. A fixed native open-porch capture supplies approximate local reflected radiance to the main hall.",
    "Local captures now use the same solar-separated sky radiance and lighting gain as the global environment, avoiding a second72870-linear visible solar peak. The original visible HDR is restored after capture.",
    "The existing thin-leaf term now follows the actual directional-light direction and shadow-attenuated radiance. Garden geometry, placement and RNG remain held."
  ],
